title: "MAGNETPy"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
abstract: "MAGNETPy is an open-source software suite that utilizes a gradient-based solver and nonlinear optimization
methods to minimize noise in magnetometer data from a tetrahedral array of sensors. This technique was developed for
the Lunar Vertex mission, and is designed to lessen magnetic cleanliness requirements on future missions that may carry
a low-cost array of magnetometers in a similar array."
